    <script type="application/ld+json">{"mainEntity":{"headline":"The role of OFDI in home-country pollution: insights from LMDI and 3SLS approaches","description":"Under the global climate crisis, harnessing investment for sustainable development is a practical and effective measure for international society. Based on the logarithmic mean Divisia index (LMDI) decomposition and three-stage least squares (3SLS) structural approaches, this study explores the home-country pollution reduction effect of Chinese OFDI activities using the city-level panel data from 2007 to 2019. The findings of this study indicate that (1) China has made a remarkable achievement in PM2.5 pollution reduction and governance, especially from the year 2012. (2) The OFDI activities can significantly decrease the home-country PM2.5 pollution. With every 1% increase in OFDI flows, the overall pollution level will decrease by 0.76%. (3) Compared with the scale mechanism, the technology and composition mechanism effects of OFDI flows are more evident in addressing the home-country PM2.5 pollution. With several related policy implications, this study may fill the lacuna of how to play the role of OFDI activities in the home country, thus promoting sustainable development in the next stage.","datePublished":"2023-05-01T00:00:00Z","dateModified":"2023-05-01T00:00:00Z","pageStart":"68636","pageEnd":"68654","sameAs":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11356-023-27301-w","keywords":["OFDI","LMDI","3SLS","Home-country effect","Sustainable development","F21","F64","Q56","Environment","general","Environmental Chemistry","Ecotoxicology","Environmental Health","Atmospheric Protection/Air Quality Control/Air Pollution","Waste Water Technology / Water Pollution Control / Water Management / Aquatic Pollution"],"image":["https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs11356-023-27301-w/MediaObjects/11356_2023_27301_Fig1_HTML.png"],"isPartOf":{"name":"Environmental Science and Pollution Research","issn":["1614-7499"],"volumeNumber":"30","@type":["Periodical","PublicationVolume"]},"publisher":{"name":"Springer Berlin Heidelberg","logo":{"url":"https://www.springernature.com/app-sn/public/images/logo-springernature.png","@type":"ImageObject"},"@type":"Organization"},"author":[{"name":"Yishuang Liu","url":"http://orcid.org/0000-0002-8586-8129","affiliation":[{"name":"Wuhan University","address":{"name":"School of Economics and Management, Wuhan University, Wuhan, China","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"},{"name":"Wuhan University","address":{"name":"Institute for International Studies, Wuhan University, Wuhan, China","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"email":"vanavampire@whu.edu.cn","@type":"Person"}],"isAccessibleForFree":false,"hasPart":{"isAccessibleForFree":false,"cssSelector":".main-content","@type":"WebPageElement"},"@type":"ScholarlyArticle"},"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage"}</script>

        
        
